WEBVTT

00:06.230 --> 00:07.820
I wouldn't be able to face Shiori.

00:08.690 --> 00:11.030
Yayoi-san?

00:12.570 --> 00:14.200
Hold on, that costume...

00:14.200 --> 00:15.110
Divine Union?

00:15.700 --> 00:18.830
<i>Just as I expected, Tenkai Shrine has someone who can achieve Divine Union too.</i>

00:21.790 --> 00:25.170
<i>is this what one would call fate?</i>

00:26.670 --> 00:28.850
<i>Matoi has experienced divine possession as well.</i>

00:29.960 --> 00:32.760
<i>And her god is—</i>

00:37.050 --> 00:39.220
Y-Yayoi!

02:12.730 --> 02:15.940
Have you identified the suspect,
Detective Taga?

02:16.650 --> 02:18.360
Masuda Toshiaki.

02:18.360 --> 02:23.240
Top brass in that shady cult, and a target of the Department of Public Safety for quite a while.

02:23.660 --> 02:24.990
Then...

02:24.990 --> 02:27.330
Haruka Luciela, IATO.

02:27.870 --> 02:30.460
What's the IATO doing here?

02:30.460 --> 02:31.830
What's the suspect's current condition?

02:31.830 --> 02:34.840
I heard he's lost all his strength and has a severe case of amnesia.

02:35.630 --> 02:39.550
It sounds very similar to what's been happening in Kamagaya.

02:39.550 --> 02:41.430
I'd like to see the files on those incidents.

02:41.430 --> 02:43.220
I'll send them over right away.

02:43.220 --> 02:44.310
Much appreciated.

02:45.900 --> 02:50.350
Don't worry, we'll solve this case.
Enjoy your vacation.

02:50.350 --> 02:51.400
I'll be on my way now.

02:51.400 --> 02:52.060
Thanks.

02:53.610 --> 02:56.190
Did you know something like this was going to happen?

02:56.980 --> 02:58.030
Not at all.

02:58.030 --> 03:01.820
Then explain to me why it feels like this junk's been following us everywhere.

03:01.820 --> 03:04.700
I'm investigating possible causes.

03:04.700 --> 03:07.000
Then quit hiding things from me.

03:07.410 --> 03:08.700
You know who this is, don't you?

03:09.210 --> 03:12.630
Even if I do, I can't tell you.

03:12.630 --> 03:15.250
I have a duty to keep IATO matters confidential.

03:15.250 --> 03:16.800
The exorcist girl, huh?

03:16.800 --> 03:18.590
I thought it was absurd.

03:21.630 --> 03:24.050
But there really are demons out there, aren't there?

03:24.050 --> 03:25.810
And you're chasing
after cases that involve them.

03:26.510 --> 03:27.770
Excuse me.

03:30.690 --> 03:31.450
Get back here!

03:31.450 --> 03:33.240
Shin-kun, stop it!

03:33.240 --> 03:34.060
Calm down!

03:34.060 --> 03:37.320
I don't give a shit what you're investigating!

03:37.320 --> 03:41.820
Don't you dare drag my daughter...
drag Matoi and her friends into this!

03:42.820 --> 03:44.450
A Small Wish.

03:47.450 --> 03:49.620
She's not receiving visitors at the moment.

03:49.620 --> 03:52.000
She is still recovering.

03:52.000 --> 03:53.540
Oh, c'mon!

03:53.540 --> 03:54.920
I understand.

03:54.920 --> 03:57.960
Please let Yayoi know that
I hope she feels better soon.

03:57.960 --> 03:59.550
I will.

03:59.550 --> 04:01.220
Let's go, Yuma-chan.

04:01.760 --> 04:04.680
But there's so much I wanna ask her!

04:04.970 --> 04:08.010
I have questions too, but now's not the time.

04:08.010 --> 04:09.890
Yuma-chi!

04:10.640 --> 04:11.640
Huh?

04:11.640 --> 04:14.400
Wow, Azu! It's been a while!

04:14.400 --> 04:18.770
I'm so sorry! I had other business to take care of,
so I couldn't get a proper greeting in.

04:19.150 --> 04:22.200
I'm Azuma Azumi, head of the Tenkai Shrine!

04:22.200 --> 04:23.780
Call me Azu!

04:23.780 --> 04:26.240
Who are you talking to?

04:26.240 --> 04:27.160
That's a secret!

04:27.410 --> 04:29.080
P-Pleased to meet you.

04:29.080 --> 04:30.700
Thank you for letting me stay—

04:30.700 --> 04:32.660
And you are Sumeragi Matoi, I presume?

04:32.660 --> 04:34.580
I've heard all about you from Yuma.

04:34.580 --> 04:37.130
She told me you're an exhibitionist. Quite the fetish you've got there!

04:37.130 --> 04:40.920
Th-That's not true! I'm not an exhibitionist!

04:40.920 --> 04:42.250
Yuma-chan!

04:42.250 --> 04:44.880
I've got <i>no</i> idea what you're talking about!

04:44.880 --> 04:45.720
Head Priestess.

04:45.720 --> 04:48.000
Yeah, yeah, I'm coming!

04:48.430 --> 04:51.000
Bye now. You girls relax and make yourselves at home.

04:51.000 --> 04:52.270
Right!

04:52.270 --> 04:55.310
I can't believe such a cute little old lady
is the head priestess here.

04:55.310 --> 04:59.650
Azu's a veteran, you know?
She's been  head priestess for over 40 years!

04:59.650 --> 05:01.150
No way!

05:03.860 --> 05:06.780
Another divine subject? I never expected this.

05:07.240 --> 05:09.950
The IATO's intelligence gathering is nothing to sniff at.

05:10.330 --> 05:12.950
I have more information about Amane Yayoi.

05:13.540 --> 05:16.830
The higher dimensional being aligned with her is dying.

05:17.250 --> 05:18.920
It's dying?

05:18.920 --> 05:23.130
I don't know whether it has simply
reached the end of its natural lifespan,

05:23.130 --> 05:24.970
or if it's too injured to remain in this world.

05:26.180 --> 05:27.220
Either way...

05:28.010 --> 05:31.680
She will lose her abilities very soon.

05:34.980 --> 05:36.640
Head Priestess?

05:36.640 --> 05:38.440
I know everything, Yayoi.

05:38.440 --> 05:40.020
You called upon your god?

05:40.400 --> 05:42.780
I'm very sorry.

05:42.780 --> 05:44.280
Yayoi.

05:44.280 --> 05:48.990
I keep telling you that your god is injured,
so don't push yourself so hard!

05:48.990 --> 05:50.530
I know.

05:50.530 --> 05:54.660
You've done enough as a
shrine maiden of Divine Union already.

05:55.160 --> 05:57.750
Consider your own happiness for once!

05:57.750 --> 06:01.170
With those knockers you've got,
you could snare as many men as you—

06:01.170 --> 06:02.670
No!

06:03.960 --> 06:05.300
I can't do that.

06:05.300 --> 06:08.130
Because you've met Shiori's daughter?

06:08.130 --> 06:09.390
You knew about that?

06:09.840 --> 06:13.600
Then you know that Matoi is unified with the God of Myriads?

06:14.140 --> 06:16.600
This is the first time I've heard,
actually. Are you sure?

06:16.600 --> 06:17.400
Yes.

06:17.850 --> 06:20.020
That's why I want to make sure

06:20.020 --> 06:23.320
that she is capable of using the Myriads properly.

06:27.850 --> 06:29.000
Wha!

06:29.610 --> 06:31.700
I hate a snoop!

06:31.700 --> 06:34.120
If you have something you want to ask, come to me directly!

06:35.540 --> 06:39.250
But I gotta say, Yayoi was amazing yesterday!

06:39.250 --> 06:42.380
She just threw her water dragon like, "Boom!"

06:43.670 --> 06:45.630
You're amazing, Yuma-chan.

06:46.510 --> 06:47.900
How so?

06:48.340 --> 06:51.590
You're so confident in
yourself as an exorcist girl.

06:51.930 --> 06:54.310
But I don't know how I feel.

06:54.310 --> 06:57.930
I want to be normal,
and I don't want to worry Shingo-san.

06:57.930 --> 06:58.800
But...

06:58.800 --> 07:03.650
The only ones who can fight the demons are you, me, and Clarie-san.

07:03.650 --> 07:04.900
True...

07:04.900 --> 07:07.190
So we've got no choice, obviously!

07:07.740 --> 07:08.400
But...

07:08.400 --> 07:11.860
Don't worry! All we gotta do is make sure nobody finds out!

07:11.860 --> 07:14.370
Wow, you make it sound so irresponsible.

07:14.370 --> 07:16.620
You're overthinking things.

07:16.620 --> 07:18.000
Just look at him!

07:18.000 --> 07:19.250
Howdy!

07:19.250 --> 07:21.960
How about you two beauts come have some fun with moi?

07:21.960 --> 07:22.960
Gross!

07:22.960 --> 07:25.040
Thanks, but no thanks.

07:25.040 --> 07:26.750
Oh, don't be like that!

07:26.750 --> 07:28.800
Leave us alone or we'll call the police!

07:28.800 --> 07:30.760
Yes? You rang?

07:30.760 --> 07:31.550
What?

07:32.050 --> 07:33.140
See, Toi-san?

07:33.640 --> 07:36.430
There's nothing wrong with being a little irresponsible.

07:36.430 --> 07:38.810
I don't think I can live like that.

07:41.350 --> 07:43.060
Thinking back...

07:43.520 --> 07:44.810
That girl was there with Shimizu,

07:45.730 --> 07:48.320
and at the incident at the bank,

07:48.980 --> 07:51.950
at Harajuka, at the shopping district...

07:53.110 --> 07:55.660
Does she have any connection with you?

07:56.160 --> 07:59.700
If she does, does that means she's related to you disappearing?

08:00.120 --> 08:02.900
<i>This is the first time I've heard,
actually. Are you sure?</i>

08:02.900 --> 08:03.800
<i>Yes.</i>

08:04.170 --> 08:06.380
<i>That's why I want to make sure</i>

08:06.380 --> 08:09.550
<i>that she is capable of using the Myriads properly.</i>

08:11.420 --> 08:13.590
As you can tell from my recording,

08:13.590 --> 08:16.350
the Tenkai Shrine has divine subjects.

08:16.350 --> 08:21.810
And they have just as much interest in Sumeragi Matoi as the Nights do.

08:21.810 --> 08:23.980
Isn't Fatima interested in her too?

08:23.980 --> 08:26.310
I thought you wanted to scout her as a potential member.

08:26.310 --> 08:27.400
No.

08:27.400 --> 08:29.300
Her religious beliefs are too different.

08:29.780 --> 08:31.440
How about IATO?

08:31.440 --> 08:33.450
Doesn't your organization want her for something?

08:33.450 --> 08:35.410
Hmm. I wonder...

08:35.410 --> 08:37.580
And I'm wondering what a major intelligence agency

08:37.580 --> 08:39.700
and the Vatican are doing
sniffing around here!

08:39.700 --> 08:41.200
When did you get here!?

08:41.200 --> 08:43.460
How did you learn our true identities?

08:43.460 --> 08:46.580
I've got my own information network to tap into.

08:46.580 --> 08:49.420
You're underestimating my people
if we're just Far East islanders to you!

08:49.420 --> 08:50.670
Head Priestess,

08:50.670 --> 08:52.720
I have been unforgivably rude to you.

08:52.720 --> 08:54.720
You really have been. Hmph!

08:54.720 --> 08:57.390
Even so, I have a question.

08:57.390 --> 09:00.600
Is Tenkai Shrine battling the Nights?

09:00.600 --> 09:04.000
I'll never tell. I'm certainly not telling a big-breasted floozy with glasses!

09:04.600 --> 09:05.850
Miss,

09:05.850 --> 09:08.940
we at Fatima are trying to
discover the Nights' intentions.

09:09.570 --> 09:12.190
Even if it's just an opinion,

09:12.610 --> 09:15.950
would you do us the honor of telling us why they interfere with this world?

09:17.490 --> 09:18.700
I will!

09:18.700 --> 09:20.620
I love handsome men!

09:20.620 --> 09:21.620
Much obliged.

09:21.620 --> 09:22.790
<i>That old hag!</i>

09:26.580 --> 09:28.580
You see, the truth is...

09:32.000 --> 09:33.170
You don't know?

09:34.300 --> 09:36.050
That's—

09:36.050 --> 09:39.050
Don't you get it? Even if you lump all higher dimensional spaces together,

09:39.050 --> 09:41.930
the world is still divided into 24 dimensions.

09:41.930 --> 09:44.480
Depending on which dimensions the Nights came from,

09:44.480 --> 09:46.850
their motivations will change too.

09:46.850 --> 09:51.400
All we can do is take whatever they throw at us.

09:51.900 --> 09:54.110
Until our hope appears, at least.

09:54.780 --> 09:55.570
Our hope?

09:56.360 --> 09:57.990
What does she mean by that?

09:58.950 --> 10:01.080
You'll know when the time comes.

10:02.240 --> 10:05.800
Oh, and about that case
you're holding, young lady...

10:07.460 --> 10:13.500
It appears you have a means of binding a god
to you and a way to measure your alignment with it,

10:13.500 --> 10:17.800
but it'll take more than that to call you a true shrine maiden of Divine Union.

10:17.800 --> 10:21.180
You'll hit your limit someday. Remember that.

10:21.180 --> 10:22.470
Is that a warning?

10:23.890 --> 10:26.100
Oh, just an old hag stickin' her nose where it don't belong!

10:29.850 --> 10:32.000
Two beers for two lovely ladies!

10:32.000 --> 10:33.770
What a doll!

10:33.770 --> 10:35.400
We'll enjoy it!

10:35.400 --> 10:38.150
Go on, go on!

10:39.950 --> 10:41.820
He's being taken for a ride!

10:41.820 --> 10:44.240
I knew this was a bad way to live your life.

10:44.240 --> 10:46.410
But he's laughing like he's having fun!

10:46.410 --> 10:48.370
He's obviously forcing it!

10:48.910 --> 10:51.900
I'll treat you if there's something that you two want to eat.

10:54.090 --> 10:55.550
Yayoi-san!

10:58.670 --> 11:01.050
Are you feeling better?

11:01.050 --> 11:03.470
Much better after some rest.

11:03.470 --> 11:05.510
You really surprised me!

11:06.560 --> 11:08.850
Did I? I'm sorry.

11:11.000 --> 11:14.440
Why did you become an exorcist girl?

11:15.320 --> 11:17.820
I was like you girls.

11:17.820 --> 11:21.780
I was born with a shrine maiden's innate ability to be possessed by a god.

11:21.780 --> 11:24.820
I believe it was God's will that led me to becoming a shrine maiden of Divine Union.

11:25.200 --> 11:26.950
A shrine maiden of Divine Union...

11:26.950 --> 11:29.250
What are their duties?

11:29.250 --> 11:32.790
To battle the demons, of course!

11:32.790 --> 11:34.630
But I don't know if I can fight.

11:34.630 --> 11:37.500
You're still saying that, Toi-san?

11:37.500 --> 11:38.630
I mean...

11:38.630 --> 11:40.260
Matoi-san. Yuma-san.

11:41.470 --> 11:44.590
Maidens of Divine Union use their prayers to welcome a god into their bodies,

11:44.590 --> 11:47.220
and use that god's power to work miracles.

11:49.310 --> 11:52.000
The strength of your wish becomes the strength of your power.

11:52.000 --> 11:53.810
The strength of your wish...

11:53.810 --> 11:55.150
becomes your power?

11:55.150 --> 11:57.360
What do you wish for, Matoi-san?

11:57.360 --> 12:01.320
A-All I want to do is to live an ordinary life.

12:01.320 --> 12:04.030
I think that's a lovely wish.

12:04.030 --> 12:05.010
Pick me, pick me!

12:05.010 --> 12:09.700
My wish is to be an awesome exorcist girl and go all Karate Kid on those demons!

12:09.700 --> 12:15.300
And then I wanna get famous,
marry a Hollywood star, and live a life of luxury!

12:15.300 --> 12:17.420
Yuma-san, those are just worldly desires.

12:17.420 --> 12:18.090
Huh!?

12:18.090 --> 12:21.300
What's the difference!?

12:28.220 --> 12:32.140
<i>Shrine maidens of Divine Union turn the strength of their wishes into power.</i>

12:32.600 --> 12:33.940
<i>I...</i>

12:33.940 --> 12:39.360
<i>I just want to be with my mom and Shingo-san and live normally.</i>

12:48.410 --> 12:50.660
It's nice to look at the ocean, isn't it?

12:51.490 --> 12:52.620
Matoi.

12:55.080 --> 12:59.210
Yayoi-san said it'd be better to ask you directly.

13:01.090 --> 13:02.710
About Mom.

13:07.180 --> 13:13.060
I met your mother 15 years ago,
when I was a freshly minted detective in Tokyo.

13:13.060 --> 13:15.940
I came here to investigate a case,
and that's how we met.

13:16.350 --> 13:18.600
It was love at first sight for both of us.

13:19.610 --> 13:23.820
She gave up being
a shrine maiden to be with me.

13:23.820 --> 13:27.240
Then we got married and had you.

13:28.110 --> 13:30.200
You were happy together?

13:31.580 --> 13:33.830
So much so that we made everyone else sick.

13:34.250 --> 13:37.920
Then why did my mom...

13:39.540 --> 13:41.460
I don't understand why either.

13:41.920 --> 13:42.920
But—

13:43.920 --> 13:46.920
She promised me she would come back,

13:47.430 --> 13:50.050
and told me to look after you until then.

13:52.640 --> 13:56.520
After she left, I threw myself into my work.

13:56.520 --> 13:59.940
I didn't want you to feel deprived of anything.

14:01.020 --> 14:01.980
But...

14:02.440 --> 14:04.360
Things turned out the way they did.

14:04.360 --> 14:06.700
I left you all alone.

14:07.240 --> 14:09.070
I'm sorry.

14:09.070 --> 14:10.650
I'm a bad father.

14:10.650 --> 14:12.330
That's not true!

14:12.330 --> 14:15.290
I knew you were trying, Shingo-san!

14:15.290 --> 14:19.370
Even when I was living at Grandma's house and I couldn't see you very often,

14:19.370 --> 14:21.670
I always knew you were trying!

14:21.670 --> 14:25.960
I'm happy we get to live together again!

14:25.960 --> 14:27.100
Really, I am.

14:30.680 --> 14:31.590
Thank you.

14:36.180 --> 14:37.430
Matoi,

14:37.430 --> 14:39.770
I'm going to keep believing in Shiori.

14:39.770 --> 14:42.440
Let's believe in her and wait for her together.

14:42.980 --> 14:45.020
Okay! I believe in her.

14:46.860 --> 14:49.490
Talking about this stuff makes me feel so out of character!

14:50.110 --> 14:51.110
What's wrong?

14:51.110 --> 14:53.800
Isn't that Tezuka-san over there?

14:54.460 --> 14:55.830
Hey, now!

14:55.830 --> 14:56.950
You've gotta be kidding me!

14:58.330 --> 14:59.580
Tezuka-san!

15:01.670 --> 15:03.500
Hang on, Poochi!

15:04.590 --> 15:05.960
S-Shin-kun?

15:05.960 --> 15:08.130
I... I think someone hurt me...

15:08.970 --> 15:09.840
Shingo-san!

15:09.840 --> 15:10.800
What happened?

15:11.300 --> 15:15.100
I picked up two hot chicks, but their eyes started looking all empty inside...

15:15.510 --> 15:16.850
Details, Poochi! I need details!

15:20.100 --> 15:21.270
Nights...

15:21.270 --> 15:23.150
And I'm the target this time?

15:23.560 --> 15:25.400
Did I find out something I shouldn't have?

15:33.320 --> 15:34.160
Get back!

15:39.200 --> 15:40.830
It's just one after the other!

15:44.750 --> 15:45.500
Yuma-san!

15:45.500 --> 15:47.400
Yeah. I felt it!

15:47.710 --> 15:48.840
A strong aura...

15:48.840 --> 15:51.300
Kuu, Kai. Let's go!

15:52.840 --> 15:53.970
Divine Union!

15:59.310 --> 16:01.700
Yayoi-san, you stay here!

16:02.770 --> 16:05.190
Poochi, where did those women go?

16:05.190 --> 16:07.520
I don't know...

16:08.730 --> 16:10.230
It's coming from the suspension bridge!

16:10.230 --> 16:11.530
Matoi, watch Poochi for me.

16:11.530 --> 16:12.860
Shingo-san!

16:15.950 --> 16:18.240
<i>What do you wish for, Matoi-san?</i>

16:18.950 --> 16:19.910
I...

16:20.490 --> 16:21.870
want to be with...

16:22.870 --> 16:25.420
my mom and Shingo-san...

16:26.040 --> 16:27.340
and live normally.

16:33.260 --> 16:35.800
That's my...

16:36.260 --> 16:37.970
They're backing each other up!

16:41.060 --> 16:42.020
Kai!

16:47.770 --> 16:48.860
They're strong!

16:53.900 --> 16:55.450
Y-You're...

16:55.450 --> 16:57.320
Please don't go any further!

16:57.820 --> 16:58.990
I'm a police officer!

16:59.410 --> 17:01.040
That may be,

17:01.040 --> 17:03.500
but this isn't an incident
ordinary humans can handle.

17:04.040 --> 17:05.410
Demons?

17:05.410 --> 17:06.290
Yes.

17:07.040 --> 17:09.590
That's not enough reason
for me to stay away!

17:09.590 --> 17:11.400
Your family will worry!

17:12.260 --> 17:14.340
I think police officers do fine work.

17:14.840 --> 17:18.300
But that doesn't mean it's okay to worry your family!

17:19.760 --> 17:21.680
You know how to hit where it hurts.

17:21.680 --> 17:23.180
I'll finish this soon.

17:23.770 --> 17:25.060
Please believe in me.

17:28.900 --> 17:31.320
Believe in her, huh?

17:31.320 --> 17:34.110
She really hit the mark.

17:43.000 --> 17:44.000
What?

17:45.040 --> 17:46.040
What is that?

17:49.290 --> 17:50.500
They combined!?

17:54.710 --> 17:55.970
It's huge!

18:11.860 --> 18:13.860
I'm not letting you hurt them!

18:13.860 --> 18:15.030
Yayoi-san!

18:15.030 --> 18:17.240
You're going to fight in such poor condition?

18:20.950 --> 18:22.280
Dragons of Water!

18:43.050 --> 18:44.760
Yayoi-san!

19:05.830 --> 19:07.040
Shiori-sama?

19:07.410 --> 19:09.830
Do I look that much like my mother?

19:11.000 --> 19:12.400
Matoi-san?

19:12.400 --> 19:15.000
Nice timing, Toi-san!

19:16.590 --> 19:17.760
Thank you.

19:17.760 --> 19:19.050
Are you okay?

19:19.050 --> 19:20.130
Yes...

19:21.630 --> 19:22.510
Yayoi-san!

19:22.510 --> 19:23.140
I'm fine!

19:32.400 --> 19:33.900
Head Priestess.

19:33.900 --> 19:36.520
I told you not to push
yourself so hard, didn't I?

19:36.770 --> 19:38.780
Leave Yayoi to me.

19:39.650 --> 19:40.740
Take care of her.

19:48.200 --> 19:54.290
My wish is really just a small,
ordinary, trivial thing, but...

19:54.750 --> 19:57.750
<i>Let's believe in Mom and wait for her together.</i>

19:58.960 --> 20:00.190
Shingo-san,

20:00.190 --> 20:03.220
but I still want to make it come true!

20:15.560 --> 20:17.360
What's happening?

20:24.490 --> 20:27.160
She's even taking my god?

20:27.160 --> 20:29.450
Is it the power of the myriad god?

20:29.450 --> 20:30.830
No.

20:30.830 --> 20:31.910
It's the power of...

20:33.370 --> 20:35.170
Matoi's wish.

20:42.720 --> 20:43.510
That's...

20:49.720 --> 20:51.520
The shape of that blade...

20:51.520 --> 20:52.980
It's the blade Shiori used!

20:52.980 --> 20:54.230
She conjured a weapon?

20:54.230 --> 20:55.730
Get 'em, Toi-san!

21:08.320 --> 21:09.580
O wish,

21:09.580 --> 21:10.780
be granted!

21:32.850 --> 21:34.520
She's awakened?

21:36.310 --> 21:39.150
So it really is true?

21:39.150 --> 21:42.980
Shiori's daughter is the one who will open the gate to the highest dimension?

21:44.570 --> 21:46.730
Feeling your heart

21:46.730 --> 21:55.490
hito wa umarenagara hikari to kage wo

21:46.730 --> 21:55.490
It's natural for us all to be followed

21:55.490 --> 22:01.500
matoi tsuzukeru

21:55.490 --> 22:01.500
by light and shadow

22:01.500 --> 22:05.000
The lonely one

22:07.170 --> 22:09.210
Feeling your heart

22:09.210 --> 22:17.930
You can obtain all you've ever wanted

22:09.260 --> 22:17.970
hoshii mono subete te ni ireru koto

22:17.930 --> 22:24.190
sore ga shiawase nano

22:17.930 --> 22:24.190
But is that truly happiness?

22:24.190 --> 22:29.150
darekaga egao nara

22:24.190 --> 22:29.150
If someone is smiling,

22:29.150 --> 22:35.660
dokokade kitto naiteru hito ga ite

22:29.150 --> 22:35.660
somewhere, someone else is probably crying

22:35.660 --> 22:41.870
surechigau hodo itooshiku omou

22:35.660 --> 22:41.870
As our paths continue to cross,

22:41.870 --> 22:46.670
kimochi ga aru

22:41.870 --> 22:46.670
our love grows stronger

22:46.670 --> 22:51.670
hitotoki no aida ni

22:46.670 --> 22:51.670
In that short span of time

22:51.670 --> 22:58.180
bokura wa minna mujun wo dakishimete

22:51.670 --> 22:58.180
we embrace all contradictions

22:58.180 --> 23:06.310
as we watch the lights that lead us to tomorrow

22:58.220 --> 23:06.360
ashita e no hikari wo mitsume nagara

23:06.310 --> 23:11.490
aruiteku no kana

23:06.310 --> 23:11.490
I wonder if we'll keep walking this path

23:14.830 --> 23:16.160
Head Priestess,

23:16.580 --> 23:20.870
when I think of what's awaiting Matoi-san, my heart aches a little.

23:20.870 --> 23:24.210
Why's that? If she doesn't
want this, she can always stop.

23:24.210 --> 23:26.420
If she doesn't wish for something,

23:26.420 --> 23:29.090
her god will never grant it.

23:29.090 --> 23:30.720
I was violated!

23:30.720 --> 23:32.340
Even though it was my first time!

23:34.090 --> 23:35.260
Shingo?

23:35.260 --> 23:36.000
Yeah?

23:36.350 --> 23:39.640
I'm going to keep believing in Mom.

23:40.390 --> 23:42.100
Believing and wishing.

23:43.940 --> 23:45.060
Okay.

23:46.110 --> 23:47.980
Geez, when did you get so...

23:48.280 --> 23:48.980
Huh?

23:50.030 --> 23:51.950
Kids, man.

23:57.700 --> 24:01.210
Because of the Nights' attack,
Shingo-san and I are locked up together!

24:01.210 --> 24:05.000
If we don't get out soon, the transformation will wear off and he'll know who I really am!

24:05.000 --> 24:07.000
Next time, "Thank You."

24:07.380 --> 24:10.290
Please! Someone save Shingo-san!
